        "",
        "Offscreen-QPA screen configuration for test_windowdrag_drop_proxy.",
        "",
        "The offscreen platform plugin gives an unnamed screen by default, and",
        "PhosphorScreens::ScreenIdentity::identifierFor() then resolves it to the",
        "empty string, which the drop-proxy registration refuses. Naming the",
        "outputs here gives the fixture a real screen id to register against.",
        "",
        "The offscreen platform plugin accepts this file via",
        "QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen:configfile=<path>. Sibling copies live in the",
        "phosphor and shell tiers and describe their own reasons. This one is",
        "the plasmazones copy."
    ],
    "screens": [
        {
            "name": "TEST-0",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "logicalDpi": 96,
            "logicalBaseDpi": 96,
            "dpr": 1
        },
        {
            "name": "TEST-1",
            "x": 1920,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 1280,
            "height": 1024,
            "logicalDpi": 96,
            "logicalBaseDpi": 96,
            "dpr": 1
        }
    ]
}
